                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[b] Dogurai [/b] is a faithful retro platformer that seems to take inspiration from classics like [i] Mega Man [/i] and [i]Ninja Gaiden[/i]. The first stage is preset, but you will be able to choose the order for some of the levels, each ending with the boss fight. On normal difficulty, you get infinite lives so it probably won't take longer than 3 hours to finish, although the harder mode would be a lot more challenging due to constant death pits. I would say that Dogurai is above average when compared to similar retro-themed platformers. The movement is relatively basic - you can double jump, slide, and occasionally juggle heavy enemies with quick-time events. I never felt like the game was unfair or too frustrating because the controls and platforming are very tight. Compared to something like [i] Tayal [/i], it's not nearly as hard. It has a decent variety of levels, including a motorcycle ride and a classic lava chase. Most of the bosses were fun, although I would argue that they needed a larger health bar (killed some of them in 20 seconds with little practice). I only finished the game once, but it seems like there might be at least one alternate ending based on collectibles. \n\n[h1] Pros: [/h1]\n\n+ nice stage variety and platforming \n+ tight movement & can rebind controls\n+ good soundtrack \n+ many achievements\n(not sure about alternate endings, it's implied)\n\n[h1] Cons: [/h1]\n\n- probably would be better with a few power-ups/sub-weapons\n\n[b] Overall Thoughts: 7/10 [/b]\n\nI think the game is solid all around and I enjoyed it from start to finish. It's a little bit expensive compared to similar games, but if you need to scratch that nostalgia for retro platformers, I think it can do the job very well. I have no real issues with it, aside from the fact that I have been playing the same type of game all my life (looking for some originality as well). \n\n[code]For more Hidden-Gems: http://store.steampowered.com/curator/31294838-Hidden-Gem-Discovery/ [/code]",
